==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Although Miso Ono & Doge has phenomenal range, their attack power is minimal so any units with high health such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] will do just fine. The Otta-smack-us may pose a threat to a weak defense so having at least 3 meatshields is recommended. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] can deal with the Otta-smack-us just fine however, minimizing the stage's difficulty.

